(7708976, 1266221, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, this contrast with the backlit leaves against a proliferation of egg-shaped bokeh.  The leaves are like airplanes flying above the clouds.  Is it a rushing stream?  Unusual and intriguing.

