Third favorite of the challenge.', '2021-12-16 22:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7708977, 1266504, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good image of this wet shepherd, keen and strong, against the outdoor greens and the sparkling bokeh.  The bokeh, pretty and whimsical, seems to soften the dog.  This adds a certain unexpected depth.  Handsome.</td>', 'Good image of this wet shepherd, keen and strong, against the outdoor greens and the sparkling bokeh.  The bokeh, pretty and whimsical, seems to soften the dog.  This adds a certain unexpected depth.  Handsome.', '2021-12-16 22:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7708978, 1266512, 173844, '<td valign="top">A shallow depth of field and this lovely image is artfully captured.  The deer seems to melt into the tall grasses, alert, motionless, and you''ve come across this gift, and you''ve given it to us.  However wonderful the deer is, as much so is the surrounding bokeh.  The colors are subtle, soft and dreamy.  I''d enjoy this on my wall.

<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A shallow depth of field and this lovely image is artfully captured.  The deer seems to melt into the tall grasses, alert, motionless, and you''ve come across this gift, and you''ve given it to us.  However wonderful the deer is, as much so is the surrounding bokeh.  The colors are subtle, soft and dreamy.  I''d enjoy this on my wall.

Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-12-16 22:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
